{"id":"igual","lemma":"igual","pos":"adv","rank":308,"glosses":["in the same way; just like","regardless, anyway","maybe"],"ipa":"/iˈɡwal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-igual.wav","examples":[{"text":"Pienso igual que usted.","en":"We think alike.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639910"},{"text":"Ya me da igual.","en":"I don't mind anymore.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67529"},{"text":"Igual no voy a ir.","en":"I'm not going anyway.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454828"},{"text":"Me da igual quién gane.","en":"I don't care who wins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741080"},{"text":"Usted no se ve igual.","en":"You don't look the same.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770206"}]}